<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9922" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-crispo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum, 1,
				v. a. (very rare, and only in <i>part.
				pres.</i> and <i>perf.</i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To curl, to give a curling, undulatory motion
			to</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">concrispati cincinni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					4, 1, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umores (se) concrispantes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					1, 1</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To brandish</i>, of a weapon: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tela,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 16, 12, 36</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
